  "steps": [
    "Toss the tofu with salt and mixed herbs.",
    "Heat a pan with olive oil and cook the tofu until golden and crispy on all sides.",
    "In the same pan, sauté the cabbage and carrot on high heat for 1–2 minutes. Keep them slightly crunchy.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together the peanut butter, Schezwan chutney, red chilli sauce, honey, lemon juice, soy sauce and salt.",
    "Add the shirataki noodles, sautéed veggies and crispy tofu to a large bowl.",
    "Pour over the sauce.",
    "Close the lid and shake everything together until well coated.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
